When used, the '''Enchanted Clock''' gives the player the option to advance either [[Minions]], [[Chocolate Factory]], [[Fann]] Timer, [[Kat]] Timer, [[Aging Items]], [[Forge]], or [[Greenhouse]]. Each of those can be activated separately from all others, after which that particular option goes on cooldown for {{Green|48 hours}}. If a member of one's co-op uses this item to speed up Minions, it goes on cooldown for all of the co-op's members. If the Kat, Fann or Forge slots are all empty, or if there are no crops planted in any Greenhouse plots, then those options cannot be activated. The Minions boost can only be used if the player is on their {{Zone|Private Island}}, and the Greenhouse boost can only be used if the player is on {{Zone|Garden}}.

== Interface ==
{{/UI}}

== Notes ==
*Using '''Enchanted Clock''' on Chocolate Factory while Time Tower perk is active will not affect its duration or cooldown.
*Using this item on Minions results in offline calculations being performed, however any minion buffs provided by [[Pets]] also apply if the player is on the island and has them equipped.
*Using this item on Minions with temporary fuels will remove {{Green|1 hour}} of its duration.
*The {{Item|Time Pocket}} doubles the {{Green|1 hour}} time skip granted by this item.

